OL,3,GNEWSA120-year-old organ that first
OL,4,Aplayed Cwm Rhondda gets second wind
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chapel organ on which the rugby
OL,7,Fanthem Cwm Rhondda was composed is to
OL,8,Fenjoy a new lease of life in time for
OL,9,Fits 120-year-old anniversary.
OL,11,FThe 750-pipe instrument at Capel
OL,12,FRhondda, in Hopkinstown near
OL,13,FPontypridd, has not been played in more
OL,14,Fthan 20 years.
OL,16,FIn 1907, John Hughes composed the hymn,
OL,17,Falso known as Bread of Heaven, and
OL,18,Fplayed it for the first time just
OL,19,Fbefore Christmas.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
