OL,4,Aplayed Cwm Rhondda gets second wind
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the Grade II-listed building, and
OL,7,Fits organ, has fallen into disrepair
OL,8,Fand has been bought by a campaign
OL,9,Fgroup.
